the app does the path by itself — Record, a Digital stroke, the C&F picks red, a second stroke below it, Stop; then it drags the second diamond of the «Macro steps» row in the Timeline's Keys tab back, so the red stroke starts while the first one is still being painted; Rewind and Play. Do not touch the mouse for 15 s. After Play both strokes must grow AT THE SAME TIME, each in its own colour, and the other diamonds must not move. This log is also written to /tmp/ph2d-macro-smoke.log
